WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.999
You've got a PollSlide team plan.

2
00:00:01.999 --> 00:00:04.808
Here's how to set up your team, in about two minutes.

3
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.952
The first time you sign in, Team admin opens by itself. You're the owner.

4
00:00:09.952 --> 00:00:14.660
You can always find it again: click your avatar at the top right, then Team admin.

5
00:00:15.612 --> 00:00:16.852
Invite people by email.

6
00:00:16.852 --> 00:00:20.141
Choose Member, or Admin if they should help you run the team.

7
00:00:20.141 --> 00:00:23.862
They get an email with a link, and a short video to get them started.

8
00:00:25.554 --> 00:00:28.165
Each invite holds a seat until it's accepted.

9
00:00:28.165 --> 00:00:30.835
If someone can't find the email, press Resend.

10
00:00:30.835 --> 00:00:32.924
Admins can invite and remove people.

11
00:00:32.924 --> 00:00:36.289
Only you, the owner, can turn an admin back into a member.

12
00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:44.352
When Jamie signs in with that email, they join automatically, on your plan: unlimited presentations, more Polly, all of it.

13
00:00:44.352 --> 00:00:46.376
You get an email when anyone joins.

14
00:00:46.376 --> 00:00:49.961
And members can leave the team themselves, whenever they like.

15
00:00:50.911 --> 00:00:53.204
Back as the owner, Jamie is on your team.

16
00:00:53.204 --> 00:00:55.106
You pay for everyone, on one bill.

17
00:00:55.106 --> 00:01:00.532
And if the team plan ever ends, members keep all their work, and simply go back to the free plan.

18
00:01:01.484 --> 00:01:02.943
That's your team, set up.

19
00:01:02.943 --> 00:01:08.137
If you'd like a hand, email help@pollslide.com, and we'll help you get everyone on board.
